### Run test locally
POST http://localhost:1234/test/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "{{serviceName}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "ratePerSecond": 1,
  "testCount": 100,
  "processingTimeMillis": 80000
}

